error[E0521]: borrowed data escapes outside of closure
 --> tests/ub_safe/compile_fail/hwcontext_device_free_callback_handle_escapes.rs
  |
  |         .set_free_callback(|ctx: DeviceContextMut<'_>| KEPT.with(|k| *k.borrow_mut() = Some(ctx)));
  |                             ---                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |                             |                          |
  |                             |                          `ctx` escapes the closure body here
  |                             |                          argument requires that `'1` must outlive `'static`
  |                             `ctx` is a reference that is only valid in the closure body
  |                             has type `DeviceContextMut<'1>`
